 "notes": [
  "Example card for the 25 cm MicroDuck; pet/body writes the measured one. Actuator ids follow walk_brain.py IDS order; the jaw is left out (not in the command file).",
  "walk limits are the robot-tested commands (vx up to 0.25, vtheta within +-0.3); turning in place is untested on the robot.",
  "turn_head uses the walk/stand policy head-pose slots, so the robot keeps balancing while it looks.",
  "bow is Pollen's ground-pick policy run to phase 0.4 and back to 1.0.",
  "Tethered to a 20 V USB-C charger on 2026-10-26; the battery value is simulated until the backpack is fitted."
 ]
